---
/**
 * solutions/hospitality/index.astro
 * Industry Vertical: Hospitality Lighting Solutions
 *
 * Phase B: Full content port from industry-vertical-hospitality.html
 * Design system: /styles/industry-vertical-system.css (shared, loaded via slot="head")
 * Glow blob: inlined from glow-blob.js
 *
 * CFG-VERT-1: main[data-vertical="hospitality"] preserved for per-vertical accent
 * CFG-CHROME-1: BaseLayout provides header/mega-menu/footer
 * CFG-COWORK-15: system CSS loaded as real stylesheet, not inlined/stripped
 */
import BaseLayout from '../../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="Hospitality Lighting Solutions — Archipelago Lighting Group"
  description="Hotels, restaurants, and hospitality venues with warm-dimming and controls. Décor-grade finishes with 2700K–3000K warm CCT and phase-cut compatibility."
  bodyClass="page-vertical-hospitality"
>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="/styles/industry-vertical-system.css" slot="head" />

  <!-- Breadcrumb -->
  <nav class="breadcrumb" aria-label="Breadcrumb">
    <a href="/">HOME</a>
    <span class="bc-sep">›</span>
    <a href="/solutions/">SOLUTIONS</a>
    <span class="bc-sep">›</span>
    <span class="bc-current">Hospitality</span>
  </nav>


 CANONICAL ALG MOCKUP - Industry-vertical solutions page - 2026-06-01
     Conformed from Claude Design Phase-A to ALG canon: CONTENT-ONLY (CFG-CHROME-1: promo-bar + site-header + site-footer stripped; Astro owns the shell);
     the glyph uses <span class="aa"> (brand-mark rule); per-vertical accents SANCTIONED (CFG-VERT-1, red wins on CTAs/activation);
