</article>
<article class="zone-card" data-zone="4">
<div class="zone-card__num">Zone 04</div>
<h3 class="zone-card__title">Corridors &amp; Common Areas</h3>
<div class="zone-card__product">select<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>RCH + sensorBLE</div>
<p class="zone-card__desc">select<span class="aa">Ⓐ</span>RCH wraps and strips with sensorBLE occupancy sensing reduce corridor energy use by up to 70%. Flicker-free output for 24/7 comfort in hallways and stairwells.</p>
</article>
<article class="zone-card" data-zone="1">
<div class="zone-card__num">Zone 05</div>
<h3 class="zone-card__title">Meeting &amp; Event Spaces</h3>
